---
import Link from './Link.astro';
import InfoBlock from './InfoBlock.astro';
---
<section id="second" class="py-20 px-10 w-full h-fit flex flex-col gap-10">
  <div class="w-full h-fit grid place-items-start gap-10">
    <div class="text-8xl leading-none font-space-grotesk w-full">
      <h1 class="font-semibold text-white tracking-normal">I AM A CREATIVE<br>AI INNOVATOR.</h1>
    </div>

    <Link href="/about">VIEW ABOUT JX7</Link>
  </div>
  
  <div class="w-full h-full grid grid-flow-row justify-items-end gap-6">
    <InfoBlock title="ABOUT JX7">
      I'm on the cutting edge of no-code tools that allow me to bring my creative visions to life. Though my methods may
      be unconventional, my dedication to the craft is unparalleled. I thrive on finding "unexpected solutions" and believe that with the right perspective.
    </InfoBlock>

    <InfoBlock title="CHALLENGES & APPROACH">
      I focused on user-centered design principles, ensuring each element served a purpose while enhancing the
      overall visual appeal. I employed responsive design techniques to maintain consistency across
      all devices and optimized performance to keep load times fast.
    </InfoBlock>
  </div>
</section>